# Mind Swap with two creature cards to choose from: Bot2 discards Ornithopter and then Memnite to hand size. Bot1 chooses
# Memnite, the second card offered, so Superior Spider-Man enters as a 4/4 Memnite copy, and "When you do, exile that card"
# exiles Memnite, the card chosen, leaving the Ornithopter in Bot2's graveyard (CR 707.2, 603.12).

[Bot1 Deck]
Sol Ring
Superior Spider-Man
Swamp
Swamp
Island
Swamp x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Ornithopter
Memnite
Island x11

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite; Ornithopter
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Superior Spider-Man.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Graveyard.Memnite)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Exile = Memnite
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Superior Spider-Man.Power = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Superior Spider-Man.Toughness = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Superior Spider-Man.Subtypes = Construct; Hero; Human; Spider
